{"speciesId":246,"names":{"fr":"Embrylex","es":"Larvitar","en":"Larvitar","ja":"ヨーギラス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It feeds on soil. After it has eaten a large mountain, it will fall asleep so it can grow."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It is born deep underground. It can't emerge until it has entirely consumed the soil around it."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Born deep under­ ground, this POKéMON becomes a pupa after eating enough dirt to make a mountain."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"LARVITAR is born deep under the ground. To come up to the surface, this POKéMON must eat its way through the soil above. Until it does so, LARVITAR cannot see its parent’s face."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"LARVITAR is born deep under the ground. To come up to the surface, this POKéMON must eat its way through the soil above. Until it does so, LARVITAR cannot see its parent’s face."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A LARVITAR is born deep under the ground. It must eat its way through the soil above and reach the surface for it to see its parents’ faces."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is born deep underground. It can’t emerge until it has entirely consumed the soil around it."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It feeds on soil. After it has eaten a large mountain, it will fall asleep so it can grow."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A Pokémon that eats soil. Once it has eaten a large mountain, it goes to sleep so it can grow."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"A Pokémon that eats soil. Once it has eaten a large mountain, it goes to sleep so it can grow."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A Pokémon that eats soil. Once it has eaten a large mountain, it goes to sleep so it can grow."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It feeds on soil. After it has eaten a large mountain, it falls asleep so it can grow."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It is born deep underground. It can’t emerge until it has entirely consumed the soil around it."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un Pokémon qui se nourrit de terre. Après avoir dévoré une montagne, il s’endort pour grandir."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A Pokémon that eats soil. Once it has eaten a large mountain, it goes to sleep so it can grow."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un Pokémon qui se nourrit de terre. Après avoir dévoré une montagne, il s’endort pour grandir."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A Pokémon that eats soil. Once it has eaten a large mountain, it goes to sleep so it can grow."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Born deep underground, it comes aboveground and becomes a pupa once it has finished eating the surrounding soil."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Born deep underground, it comes aboveground and becomes a pupa once it has finished eating the surrounding soil."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se nourrit de terre. Une fois qu’il a absorbé une montagne, il s’endort et commence à évoluer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se alimenta de tierra. Después de comer una gran montaña, se duerme y empieza a crecer."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It feeds on soil. After it has eaten a large mountain, it falls asleep so it can grow."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"土を 食べて 生きている。 大きな 山ひとつ 食べ終わると 成長のため 眠りはじめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il vit très profond sous terre. Il n’en sort pour évoluer qu’après avoir dévoré tout ce qui l’entourait."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Nace muy profundo en el suelo y sube a la superficie, donde se convierte en una larva comiéndose la tierra que lo rodea."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Born deep underground, it comes aboveground and becomes a pupa once it has finished eating the surrounding soil."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"地底 奥深くで 生まれる。 まわりの 土を たいらげると 地上に 現われ サナギになる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Embrylex est né sous terre. Pour remonter à la surface, ce Pokémon doit manger la terre au-dessus de lui. Jusqu’à ce qu’il y parvienne, Embrylex ne peut pas voir le visage de ses parents."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Larvitar nace bajo tierra a gran profundidad. Para subir a la superficie, este Pokémon debe comer lo que encuentra en su camino para abrirse paso. Y, hasta que no está arriba, no puede verles la cara a sus padres."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Larvitar is born deep under the ground. To come up to the surface, this Pokémon must eat its way through the soil above. Until it does so, Larvitar cannot see its parents."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"地中 深くで 生まれる ヨーギラスは 土を 食べ尽くして 地上へ 出ないと 親の 顔を 見る ことが できないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Embrylex est né sous terre. Pour remonter à la surface, ce Pokémon doit manger la terre au-dessus de lui. Jusqu’à ce qu’il y parvienne, Embrylex ne peut pas voir le visage de ses parents."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Larvitar nace bajo tierra a gran profundidad. Para subir a la superficie, este Pokémon debe comer lo que encuentra en su camino para abrirse paso. Y, hasta que no está arriba, no puede verles la cara a sus padres."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Larvitar is born deep under the ground. To come up to the surface, this Pokémon must eat its way through the soil above. Until it does so, Larvitar cannot see its parents."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"地中 深くで 生まれる ヨーギラスは 土を 食べ尽くして 地上へ 出ないと 親の 顔を 見る ことが できないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il naît sous terre et doit se frayer un chemin à coups de mâchoire pour rejoindre ses parents à la surface. Il déteste la lumière, qui l’éblouit."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Nace bajo el suelo y, para reunirse con sus progenitores en la superficie, asciende comiendo tierra. Evita la luz directa porque lo deslumbra."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Born underground, it eats its way through dirt to the surface, where its parents are. It doesn’t deal well with the bright light it finds there."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"地下で 生まれ 土を 食いながら 親の いる 地上を 目指す。 まぶしいので 光は 苦手だよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il se nourrit des nutriments présents dans le sol. Il lui faut dévorer l’équivalent d’une petite montagne pour se changer en chrysalide."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Crece alimentándose de nutrientes del suelo. Tras devorar el equivalente a una pequeña montaña, se prepara para convertirse en pupa."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Raised on nutrients it finds in the dirt, it eats roughly a mountain’s worth of dirt before it becomes a pupa."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"土の 中の 栄養で 育つ。 およそ 山 １つ分の 土を 食うことで サナギに なるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il naît dans les profondeurs du sol. Après avoir englouti toute la terre qui l’entoure, il fait surface et se change en chrysalide."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Nace en el subsuelo a gran profundidad. Tras ingerir la tierra que lo rodea, emerge a la superficie y se convierte en pupa."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Born deep underground, it comes aboveground and becomes a pupa once it has finished eating the surrounding soil."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"地底 奥深くで 生まれる。 まわりの 土を たいらげると 地上に 現われ サナギになる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il vit en se nourrissant de terre. Après avoir dévoré une montagne, il s’endort et entame sa croissance."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se alimenta de tierra. Después de devorar el equivalente a una montaña, se duerme y empieza a crecer."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It feeds on soil